WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.766
Bat liked the barn.

2
00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:32.233
He liked Cow and Pig and Cat.

3
00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:37.292
He wanted to play with them.

4
00:00:37.293 --> 00:00:46.245
So Bat flew to Cow.

5
00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:55.706
"Will you play with me?" he said.

6
00:00:55.707 --> 00:01:01.717
"No!" said Cow. "I do not like bats.

7
00:01:01.718 --> 00:01:11.914
Please go away!"

8
00:01:11.915 --> 00:01:15.476
So Bat left.

9
00:01:15.477 --> 00:01:22.912
Bat flew to Pig.

10
00:01:22.913 --> 00:01:27.510
"Will you play with me?" said Bat.

11
00:01:27.511 --> 00:01:37.381
"No," said Pig. "I do not like bats.

12
00:01:37.382 --> 00:01:45.382
Please go away!"

13
00:01:45.383 --> 00:01:50.856
So Bat left.

14
00:01:50.857 --> 00:01:57.488
Bat flew to Cat.

15
00:01:57.489 --> 00:02:02.995
"Will you play with me?"

16
00:02:02.996 --> 00:02:08.682
"No," said Cat. "I do not like bats.

17
00:02:08.683 --> 00:02:11.351
Please go away."

18
00:02:11.352 --> 00:02:16.941
So Bat left.

19
00:02:16.942 --> 00:02:31.820
No one wanted to play with Bat.

20
00:02:31.821 --> 00:02:37.542
He was all alone.

